WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:08.270
In 1955 Johnny Cash wrote and recorded a song
that would become a worldwide hit: Folsom

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:09.710
Prison Blues.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:16.480
In 1887 Van Gogh admitted himself to a mental
asylum in Southern France and spent his time

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:21.720
painting 30 beautiful pieces of art that are
almost priceless today.

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:28.020
In 1603 Shakespeare wrote Othello, one of
his many masterpieces.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:33.570
These masters of the arts created one of a
kind originals using nothing but the contents

00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:39.660
of their own brains, as though their works
were like gifts from the heavens.

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:45.800
The only problem is that this is utter crap,
all the aforementioned creations were stolen.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:52.960
And I’ll tell you how and why in a few seconds,
but first a quick word about our sponsor RAID:

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.580
